
units           real
boundary p p p
atom_style      full

read_restart final_state_Run2_ext.restart
  restoring atom style full from restart
  orthogonal box = (-420 -420 -420) to (420 420 420)
  2 by 2 by 7 MPI processor grid
  restoring pair style lj/cut from restart
